WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.199
The global spherical shell conjecture.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.363
Class seven surfaces are the last unclassified compact complex surfaces.

3
00:00:07.513 --> 00:00:10.621
A spherical shell in each would make it a blown-up Hopf surface.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.834
Claimed: each one with b two positive has a shell.

5
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.380
Manuscript only, not in Lean.
